{"blocks":[["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-1815","live.object / live.path / live.observer: Max patcher objects that parallel LiveAPI. Often useful when wiring patcher logic directly, but JS developers typically prefer LiveAPI.",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)","Core Objects"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-2010","Global JS functions:",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)","Core Objects"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-2039","post(\"msg\"): print to Max console.",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)","Core Objects","Global JS functions:"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-2081","error(\"msg\"): print in red.",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)","Core Objects","Global JS functions:"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-2116","arrayfromargs(arguments): convert Max callback arguments to a JS array.",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)","Core Objects","Global JS functions:"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-2195","Key LOM Concepts",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-2218","Root: The entry point is always live_set.",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)","Key LOM Concepts"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-2270","Paths: Use unquotedpath (preferred) instead of path to avoid issues with spaces in names.",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)","Key LOM Concepts"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-2372","Hierarchy: Objects are nested (live_set tracks 0 clip_slots 1 clip).",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)","Key LOM Concepts"]],["c74/M4L/Concept/LiveAPI%20Overview%20for%20JS/","source-block-2451","Data Types: Many properties are integers or symbols (0/1 for bool, quoted strings for symbols).",["Max for Live JavaScript Overview (Max 8)","Key LOM Concepts"]]],"format_version":5}